        "details": {
            "description": "<p>Ghostly starships battle ceaselessly in this sector.</p>",
            "disable": "<p>@Check[deception|dc:36] (master; scanners) to trick a spectral starship into believing its battle is won; @Check[religion|dc:34] (master; magic conduit) to exorcise one spectral starship; one success disables a spectral starship, and four successes are required to disable the haunt</p>",
