            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Tech Core"
            },
            "reset": "<p>The spectral starships can't be permanently destroyed unless they're exorcised. They reform over the course of 24 hours, after which the haunt can trigger again.</p>",
            "routine": "<p>(1 action per spectral starship) The spectral starships operate in pairs and maneuver to surround their targets whenever possible. On a typical round, one pair performs Flyby Formation, while the other pair opens fire, each of them firing one spectral laser Strikes. The haunt fights until all spectral starships are exorcised or temporarily destroyed.</p>"
